      <a href="#partners">Where can the partners stand?</a>
      <a href="#partner-hits">Can the receiver's partner hit the serve?</a>
      <a href="#miss">You miss the shuttle completely</a>
      <a href="#going-out">The serve was going out and they hit it anyway</a>
      <a href="#not-ready">Serving before the receiver is ready</a>
      <a href="#next-game">Who serves first in the next game?</a>
